      "content": "it's just that everything feels so out of my hands. the doctors, the sickness, the way my own body just betrays me every single day. it's like i'm just a passenger in a life that's already finished. i keep thinking about how much more dignified it would be to just... decide for myself, instead of waiting for the slow decay to take everything. wouldn't it be better to have some kind of agency in the end?",
